{
  "manifest_version": "0.4",
  "name": "japan-food-delivery-mcp",
  "display_name": "Japan Food Delivery MCP",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Japan food delivery data via Uber Eats JP for AI agents. Search restaurants and get menus.",
  "long_description": "Japan Food Delivery MCP です。\\n\\nAIエージェント（Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT等）から日本国内のUber Eatsレストラン検索・メニューデータを取得できます。\\n\\n## 提供ツール\\n\\n| ツール | 内容 |\\n|---|---|\\n| `search_restaurants(city, cuisine, max_results)` | Uber Eats Japanでレストランを検索 |\\n| `get_restaurant_menu(restaurant_url, max_items)` | 特定レストランのフルメニューを取得 |\\n| `get_japan_food_info()` | サーバーメタデータを取得 |\\n\\n## 動作要件\\n\\n- APIFY_TOKEN環境変数が必要\\n- 依存解決に [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) を使用\\n- 関連 Apify Actor: sourabhbgp/ubereats-scraper (country=JP対応)",
  "author": {
    "name": "atushi1841",
    "url": "https://github.com/atushi1841"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/atushi1841/japan-food-delivery-mcp"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/atushi1841/japan-food-delivery-mcp",
  "server": {
    "type": "python",
    "entry_point": "src/stdio_main.py",
    "mcp_config": {
      "command": "uv",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "--directory",
        "${__dirname}",
        "src/stdio_main.py"
      ]
    }
  },
  "compatibility": {
    "platforms": [
      "darwin",
      "linux",
      "win32"
    ],
    "runtimes": {
      "python": ">=3.10"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "japan",
    "food",
    "delivery",
    "uber-eats",
    "restaurant",
    "menu",
    "scraping"
  ],
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "search_restaurants",
      "description": "Search restaurants on Uber Eats Japan.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "city": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "City name (e.g. Tokyo, Osaka)"
          },
          "cuisine": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Cuisine keyword"
          },
          "max_results": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Max results (default 20)"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "city"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "get_restaurant_menu",
      "description": "Get full menu for a specific restaurant.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "restaurant_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Restaurant URL"
          },
          "max_items": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Max menu items (default 100)"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "restaurant_url"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "get_japan_food_info",
      "description": "Get server metadata and information.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "required": []
      }
    }
  ]
}